      "@type": "http://www.w3id.org/pdto#DisposalInstruction",
      "http://schema.org/description": "Disassemble the crib into main material streams for proper recycling. - Solid wood components: send to wood recycling or energy recovery. - Melamine board parts: dispose via controlled waste facilities. - Metal fittings: recycle as scrap metal. - Plastic wheels: recycle if local facilities allow, otherwise landfill. Ensure separation of materials before disposal to maximize recycling efficiency.",
